      "body": "website link: https://www.chinesenamegenerator.xyz/\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ebcf5f82-cc1e-4aa6-b5f6-9fd6befd9c28)\n\n### Discover the Art of Chinese Naming\nChinese Name Generator seamlessly blends tradition and modernity, creating names rooted in historical heritage and poetic meaning. With personalized settings, you can craft a name that tells your story and honors Chinese culture.\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/19192e33-bbed-4629-b16e-ead60b30cb14)\n\n#### ✨ Deep Cultural Roots\nSurnames and given names carefully selected from classical literature, mythology, and historical records.\n\n#### ⚡ Personalized Name Generation\nInstantly generate names based on your preferences — including gender, meaning, birth date, and poetic references.\n\n#### 📖 Rich Background Explanations\nEach name comes with detailed cultural context, meanings, and historical insights.\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2ed04dad-d3b8-476c-8f7b-8319ac63a153)",
